5. What Examiners Are Looking For
1. Balanced Thinking

Not:

“System succeeded”

But:

“Technically successful but limited business success due to cost overruns”

2. Evidence-Based Answers

Always use:

Data from the case
Clear justification
3. Structured Responses

Use this format:

1. Identify → 2. Explain → 3. Evaluate → 4. Recommend

4. Link to Business Value

Every technical point should answer:

“So what?”

